# Regenerable local run products: the complete F32 logit bytes (18 positions x
# 607,744 bytes = 10.43 MiB) and the uv-managed virtual environment. Both are
# reconstructed by the recorded invocation from the checked-in `pyproject.toml`
# and `uv.lock`, and neither is evidence -- the evidence is the per-position
# SHA-256 over exactly these bytes, which is retained under `results/`.
#
# The rule covers this one directory and nothing broader, per the workload
# profile's storage policy: no checkpoint, tokenizer, or reference-source bytes
# are stored in this repository at any path, and a spike that needs them
# declares its own local directory and ignores exactly that.
/local-work/
